==Description==
'''Plushie Snowman''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[The Final Act Event]] on any map and gamemode. It was obtainable by killing enemies which each had a chance to drop '''Plushie Snowmen''', though these enemies had no special accessories to indicate that they would drop '''Plushie Snowmen'''. 

It was used to complete Levels on the [[The Final Act Event|The Final Act Battle Pass]]. The amount earned per wave varied based on the gamemode played.

It took the appearance of a snowman head with black buttons for eyes.

